{"unit_id":"mrbeandev__dsh-desktop-ui#card-zh","repo":"mrbeandev/dsh-desktop-ui","commit":"4cbaad36211e3b2625f19d663e105735d4e0d0a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-ui 是面向 DSH Web 的桌面模式插件：它把主对话区域变成可操作多个会话窗口的画布，并在侧边栏提供开关。用户可拖动、缩放、排列、最小化和弹出会话窗口，通过任务栏切换窗口，也可设置背景图片与透明度。窗口布局由浏览器即时保存，并可通过 DSH 配置服务跨重启恢复；壁纸图片保存在当前浏览器。适合需要同时查看多个 DSH 会话的 Web 用户；不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.mjs:1653-1665","index.mjs:17-21"]}
{"unit_id":"mrbeandev__dsh-desktop-ui#card-en","repo":"mrbeandev/dsh-desktop-ui","commit":"4cbaad36211e3b2625f19d663e105735d4e0d0a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-ui adds desktop mode to DSH Web, showing sessions as movable windows on one canvas. A taskbar switches, arranges, and minimizes them; sessions can pop out. Layouts persist through DSH config, while wallpaper images stay in the browser. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.mjs:1653-1665","index.mjs:17-21"]}
