{"unit_id":"mrbeandev__dsh-desktop-ui#feature-1","repo":"mrbeandev/dsh-desktop-ui","commit":"4cbaad36211e3b2625f19d663e105735d4e0d0a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-ui 的「会话窗口」功能：把 DSH 会话显示在主区域的独立窗口中。点击侧边栏会话可打开窗口；同一会话再次打开时会恢复并聚焦已有窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.mjs:111-127","client/index.mjs:1653-1658"]}
{"unit_id":"mrbeandev__dsh-desktop-ui#feature-2","repo":"mrbeandev/dsh-desktop-ui","commit":"4cbaad36211e3b2625f19d663e105735d4e0d0a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-ui 的「窗口排列与任务栏」功能：在桌面画布中移动、缩放、最小化或最大化窗口，并使用级联、网格或分栏布局。任务栏可聚焦窗口、开始新会话或显示桌面。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.mjs:169-240","client/index.mjs:1494-1630"]}
{"unit_id":"mrbeandev__dsh-desktop-ui#feature-3","repo":"mrbeandev/dsh-desktop-ui","commit":"4cbaad36211e3b2625f19d663e105735d4e0d0a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-ui 的「弹出会话」功能：点击窗口的弹出按钮后，在独立浏览器窗口显示该会话；可通过弹回操作或关闭弹出窗口，把会话放回桌面。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.mjs:975-1025","client/index.mjs:1028-1062"]}
{"unit_id":"mrbeandev__dsh-desktop-ui#feature-4","repo":"mrbeandev/dsh-desktop-ui","commit":"4cbaad36211e3b2625f19d663e105735d4e0d0a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-ui 的「桌面背景」功能：在插件设置中选择壁纸并调整画布、任务栏和图片透明度；壁纸布局可设为填充、适应、居中或平铺，图片保存在浏览器 IndexedDB。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.mjs:1166-1202","client/index.mjs:1690-1735"]}
{"unit_id":"mrbeandev__dsh-desktop-ui#caveat-1","repo":"mrbeandev/dsh-desktop-ui","commit":"4cbaad36211e3b2625f19d663e105735d4e0d0a8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-ui 使用前须知：布局可经 DSH 配置服务保存，壁纸图片则存于当前浏览器的 IndexedDB，因此图片不会随配置同步到其他浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/index.mjs:1166-1202","client/index.mjs:800-826"]}
